[9740]="7000A2A9\n1\tDefeat Veteran Tomb-robber (total: 8)\030Defeat Scouting Tomb-robber (total: 8)\tTomb-robbers can be found among the hills north and west of Ost Forod, in Tyrn Fornech. Rowena Parker has asked you to defeat the experienced tomb-robbers that prowl the hills of Tyrn Fornech.\n2\tTalk to Rowena Parker in Ost Forod\tRowena Parker is at Ost Forod, the old watch-post in Tyrn Fornech. You have defeated many experienced tomb-robbers in Tyrn Fornech and should return to Rowena with the tale of your success.\n",
[9741]="7000D4E8\n1\tMinas Maur is one of the large towers of Barad Gúlaran, south of Gath Forthnír. You must travel to Barad Gúlaran and defeat the emissary from Goblin-town inside Minas Maur. Brúfair suggested you take allies with you.\t\n2\tTalk to Brúnfair\tGath Forthnir is north of Barad Gúluran. Having defeated Prakhum, return to Gath Forthnír and let Brúnfair know what you have done.\n",
[9742]="70008076\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Fornost City (total: 6)\030Defeat goblins in Fornost City (total: 4)\tOrcs and goblins can be found near the base of the keep within the city of Fornost. Gareth Copp has asked you to help the forces of the North Downs by reducing the numbers of the Orcs and goblins at Fornost.\n2\tReturn to Gareth Copp\tGareth Copp is at the camp of the Free Peoples in the southernmost part of Fornost. Your efforts have weakened the forces of Angmar, as Gareth Copp requested. You should return to Gareth at once with news of your victory.\n",
[9743]="7001927C\n1\tSoak lumber-pile with liquid (total: 9)\030Collect contents from crates (total: 6)\tThe lumber and crates are at the Orc-encampment of Drûmaudhul, north-west of Talan Fanuidhol. Bahanneth has asked you to sabotage the lumber the Orcs have cut for their war-machines. He also wants you to steal the contents of the storage crates from their surrounding encampments.\n2\tTalk to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Drûmaudhul. You should return to Bahanneth with the metal parts and let him know of your success.\n",
[9744]="7003EB06\n1\tDefeat Stone-trolls in Nan Tornaeth (total: 6)\tThere are Stone-trolls encamped at the ruins of Barad Glamgil in Nan Tornaeth, in the Trollshaws. While in Nan Tornaeth, you should drive out the Stone-trolls which have settled there.\n",
[9745]="7005AB09\n1\tDefeat Welkin-lofts predators (total: 10)\tNáth has asked you to defeat any predators you find in the wilds near Fellgát.\n2\tTalk to Náth\tYou have hunted predators near Fellgát, and made it a little safer for the dwarves. You should talk to Náth.\n",
[9746]="7002C331\n1\tThe Murderous Pit lies to the east of Brifard's camp. Brifard has asked that you search the Field of Parth Celebrant around the Murderous Pit for any sign of the wolves' usual prey.\t\n2\tTalk to Brifard\tBrifard is at his camp to the west of the Murderous Pit. You should take knowledge of what you have seen back to Brifard.\n",
[9747]="70046C23\n1\tDefeat ravenous battle-cats (total: 6)\tRavenous battle-cats can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn. Ereblen has asked you to defeat wandering battle-cats brought to North Ithilien by the Khundolar in the hope that they will no longer prey on Ithilien's wildlife.\n2\tTalk to Ereblen\tEreblen can be found to the north-west of Henneth Annûn. You have defeated the wandering battle-cats and should now return to Ereblen.\n",
[9748]="7000D3D4\n1\tDefeat Wargs in Fasach-larran (total: 8)\tWargs can be found in Fasach-larran, the foothills north of Aughaire. They can also be found in the fortress of Tór Gailvin, north-east of Aughaire. Osbail has asked you to defeat the Wargs that threaten Aughaire from the north, and in return, she will tell Crannog of your efforts.\n2\tTalk to Osbail\tOsbail is by Crannog's ruling-seat in Aughaire, west of the settlement's centre island. You have defeated many of the Wargs that prowl Fasach-larran and should report of your success to Osbail.\n",
[9749]="700195C1\n1\tDeliver the wolf-pelts to Nos Grimsong at Frerin's Court\030Collect wolf-pelts (total: 4)\tWolf-packs may be found inhabiting the frozen lake in the valley beneath Edhelion and the Berghold, south-west of the ruins of Edhelion. Laergil has asked you to collect wolf-hides and deliver them to Nos Grimsong, west at Frerin's Court in the centre of the valley below Edhelion.\n",
[9750]="70047A56\n1\tEnter the enemy encampment of Fushaum Gund\tThe Orc encampment of Fushaum Gund is located on the eastern slopes of the Slag-hills. You should destroy battle horns and tools in the Orc encampment to hamstring any rallying cry.\n2\tDestroy battle horns (total: 4)\030Destroy tools (total: 8)\tThe Orc encampment of Fushaum Gund is located on the eastern slopes of the Slag-hills. You should destroy battle horns and tools in the Orc encampment to hamstring any rallying cry.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many battle horns and tools at Fushaum Gund.\n",
[9751]="70017596\n1\tTalk to Márus at the Shadowed Refuge\030Collect the mithril chisel from Folok\tFolok has been seen in the south-west portion of the Redhorn Lodes, near Malmezel, at the western edge of the Redhorn Lodes. Márus has asked you to defeat the Orc Folok and recover the mithril chisel.\n",
[9752]="70028C6F\n1\tDefeat Dunlendings in the Isendale (total: 7)\tThe Dunlendings who attacked the Rohirrim patrol might be found in the valley west of Forthbrond. Ardwyn has asked you to find the Dunlendings responsible for attacking his patrol and bring them to justice.\n2\tTalk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, east of the valley. You should bring the news of your succes to Ardwyn.\n",
[9753]="700418C8\n1\tTalk to Grimbeorn and receive the supplies you will need for your journey\tGrimbeorn is outside his lodge, and can give you the supplies you will need to begin your journey.\n",
[9754]="70054885\n1\tYou are fated to labour in service to the Dark Lord.\t\n2\tCollect crude iron bars at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment\tCrude iron bars can be found at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment.\n3\tHeat the iron bars in one of the forges at Anghnúl\tForges can be found at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment.\n4\tHammer the iron bar into the shape of an Orkish blade\tAnvils can be found at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment.\n5\tHone the Orkish blade on a grindstone\tGrindstones can be found at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment.\n6\tHeat the Orkish blade in one of the forges at Anghnúl\tForges can be found at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment.\n7\tQuench and temper the blade in a tub at Anghnúl\tA tub can be found at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment.\n8\tSet the finished Orkish blade on a weapon rack at Anghnúl\tA rack can be found at Anghnúl, the Forge of Torment.\n",
[9755]="7004A64C\n1\tReclaim your armour\030Reclaim your ring\030Collect Elrond's writings\tYour belongings and Elrond's writings can be found throughout Tham Send in the Last Homely House. Elrond has prepared your belongings and also compiled writings on the Third Age for your perusal. You should collect them before you depart.\n2\tTalk to Elrond in Tham Send\tElrond is within Tham Send in the Last Homely House. You have collected your belongings and Elrond's writings and should now return to Elrond.\n",
